* Auto-generated testbench for voltage divider: R420/R442
* Expected Vout = 3.3 * 0.500000 = 1.6500 V
* Model: ideal passives (exact, unloaded)

VIN VREF_ 0 DC 3.3
R420 VREF_ OPP_V1 56k
R442 OPP_V1 0 56k

.control
op 
let vout_sim = v(OPP_V1)
let error_pct = abs(vout_sim - 1.65) / 1.65 * 100
echo "vout_sim=$&vout_sim error_pct=$&error_pct expected=1.65" > ShiroFOC/Manual_Rebuild/review/schematic_review_2026-09-26/spice_work/voltage-divider_R420_R442.out
quit
.endc

.end
